{"unit_id":"feiyang-dev__dsh-vault#card-zh","repo":"feiyang-dev/dsh-vault","commit":"ab47231c0fd45bc7dcddc6b02498598cc3909806","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vault 是 DeepSeek Harness 的数据备份与恢复插件，面向 Web 客户端并提供主机端和设置页界面。它将会话、工作区和配置快照保存到用户主目录的 ~/.dsh-backups，通过启动时备份和手动操作保护本地数据。它能检测会话疑似清空、查看备份历史、立即备份、按范围恢复或删除备份，并提供 backup_vault 模型工具及「备份管理」设置页。适合希望保留本机 DSH 会话与工作区数据并在需要时找回的用户；无需额外 API 密钥，备份包含凭据配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1-16","lib/index.js:594-668","lib/client.js:8-18"]}
{"unit_id":"feiyang-dev__dsh-vault#card-en","repo":"feiyang-dev/dsh-vault","commit":"ab47231c0fd45bc7dcddc6b02498598cc3909806","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-vault backs up local DeepSeek Harness sessions, workspace data, and settings under ~/.dsh-backups. It detects suspected wipes and supports backup history, scoped restore, and deletion through a model tool or Web settings page. No API key is needed; snapshots include credentials.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1-16","lib/index.js:594-668","lib/client.js:8-18"]}
